        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Development of Our National Border with Mexico</title>\n  <script>\n    window.MathJax = {\n      tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$'], ['\\\\(', '\\\\)']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$'], ['\\\\[', '\\\\]']] }\n    };\n  </script>\n  <script async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n  <style>\n    * {\n      box-sizing: border-box;\n    }\n\n    html,\n    body {\n      margin: 0;\n      min-width: 1480px;\n      background: #e7e5e0;\n    }\n\n    body {\n      color: #393939;\n      font-family: \"Times New Roman\", Times, serif;\n      overflow-x: auto;\n    }\n\n    .page {\n      position: relative;\n      width: 1480px;\n      height: 2186px;\n      margin: 0 auto;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      border-left: 4px solid #292929;\n      border-right: 4px solid #292929;\n      background: #f7f3ec;\n      box-shadow: 14px 0 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.14), -10px 0 18px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);\n    }\n\n    .content {\n      padding: 100px 35px 75px;\n    }\n\n    .title {\n      margin: 0;\n      color: #303030;\n      font-family: Georgia, \"Times New Roman\", serif;\n      font-size: 48px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      letter-spacing: 4.2px;\n      line-height: 1.74;\n    }\n\n    .title-line {\n      display: block;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n\n    .subtitle {\n      margin: 64px 0 0;\n      color: #444444;\n      font-family: Georgia, \"Times New Roman\", serif;\n      font-size: 27px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      letter-spacing: 0.45px;\n      line-height: 1.25;\n    }\n\n    .subtitle-line {\n      display: block;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n\n    .speech {\n      margin: 48px 0 0;\n      padding-left: 54px;\n      color: #505050;\n      font-size: 24px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      line-height: 1.4;\n    }\n\n    .speech li {\n      margin: 0;\n      padding: 0;\n    }\n\n    .speech li + li {\n      margin-top: 40px;\n    }\n\n    .speech p {\n      margin: 0;\n      text-align: justify;\n      text-align-last: left;\n    }\n\n    .speech .line {\n      display: block;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n\n    .speech li::marker {\n      color: #3e3e3e;\n      font-size: 1.15em;\n    }\n\n    .media-row {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: 875px 1fr;\n      column-gap: 52px;\n      align-items: start;\n      margin-top: 55px;\n    }\n\n    .placeholder {\n      position: relative;\n      width: 875px;\n      height: 722px;\n      margin: 0;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      background:\n        linear-gradient(165deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18), transparent 32%),\n        linear-gradient(25deg, rgba(35, 35, 35, 0.26), transparent 42%),\n        radial-gradient(ellipse at 30% 38%, rgba(220, 220, 220, 0.52) 0 10%, transparent 11%),\n        radial-gradient(ellipse at 52% 53%, rgba(54, 54, 54, 0.55) 0 12%, transparent 13%),\n        radial-gradient(ellipse at 73% 57%, rgba(205, 205, 205, 0.34) 0 9%, transparent 10%),\n        #969692;\n      border: 1px solid rgba(80, 80, 80, 0.2);\n    }\n\n    .placeholder-label {\n      position: absolute;\n      right: 18px;\n      bottom: 15px;\n      left: 18px;\n      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);\n      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n      font-size: 16px;\n      font-weight: 400;\n      letter-spacing: 0.3px;\n      text-align: center;\n    }\n\n    .photo-caption {\n      width: 450px;\n      padding-top: 7px;\n      color: #575757;\n      font-family: Georgia, \"Times New Roman\", serif;\n      font-size: 23px;\n      font-style: italic;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      line-height: 1.25;\n    }\n\n    .photo-caption .line {\n      display: block;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n\n    .footer {\n      position: absolute;\n      right: 35px;\n      bottom: 43px;\n      left: 35px;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: baseline;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      color: #383838;\n      font-family: Georgia, \"Times New Roman\", serif;\n      font-size: 19px;\n      font-style: italic;\n      font-weight: 700;\n    }\n\n    .page-number {\n      font-style: normal;\n      letter-spacing: 0.8px;\n    }\n\n    .publication {\n      letter-spacing: 1.8px;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"page\">\n    <section class=\"content\">\n      <h1 class=\"title\">\n        <span class=\"title-line\">DEVELOPMENT OF OUR NATIONAL</span>\n        <span class=\"title-line\">BORDER WITH MEXICO</span>\n      </h1>\n\n      <h2 class=\"subtitle\">\n        <span class=\"subtitle-line\">LIC. ARMANDO GONZALES SOTO OF CIUDAD JUAREZ DELIVERED A PREPARED SPEECH AT THE</span>\n        <span class=\"subtitle-line\">CONFERENCE:</span>\n      </h2>\n\n      <ul class=\"speech\">\n        <li>\n          <p>\n            <span class=\"line\">Distinguished visitors at this conference on urban and border development sponsored by the Texas Society of</span>\n            <span class=\"line\">Architects: The Governor of our state has asked me to extend to you his warmest greetings with the hope that</span>\n            <span class=\"line\">by your presence we may broaden our concepts of architecture and favorably apply our knowledge of new</span>\n            <span class=\"line\">methods toward the never-ending demands of a better life.</span>\n          </p>\n        </li>\n\n        <li>\n          <p>\n            <span class=\"line\">This very important science of architecture that man has created and raised to the height of the fine arts is</span>\n            <span class=\"line\">based on principles and elemental theories of physics and is further developed by powerful mathematical re-</span>\n            <span class=\"line\">sources. Its concepts are governed by the sublime teachings of esthetics, and it is both a beautiful and a useful</span>\n            <span class=\"line\">art. In the field of human activity it is the one science that most resembles nature in its being by the admirable</span>\n            <span class=\"line\">harmony with which it unites all the elements of knowledge to satisfy both reason and emotion.</span>\n          </p>\n        </li>\n\n        <li>\n          <p>\n            <span class=\"line\">For history, architecture constitutes a most valuable source of information, aided in this function by its adja-</span>\n            <span class=\"line\">cent science, archeology. It would be futile to give a brief account of the history of this subject, which is of</span>\n            <span class=\"line\">your complete knowledge, in order to prove that it constitutes a valuable and indirect historical source.</span>\n          </p>\n        </li>\n\n        <li>\n          <p>\n            <span class=\"line\">The men of our times, and very specially those who ardently practice architecture, have a great responsibility.</span>\n            <span class=\"line\">We must not forget that posterity will judge us according to that which we leave behind.</span>\n          </p>\n        </li>\n\n        <li>\n          <p>\n            <span class=\"line\">Apart from this we must recognize that if it is true that architecture has partly lost its form, it has, on the other</span>\n            <span class=\"line\">hand, approached man in his unvaried objectives of yielding a true social service, thus adding to his happiness</span>\n            <span class=\"line\">and well-being.</span>\n          </p>\n        </li>\n\n        <li>\n          <p>\n            <span class=\"line\">I am certain that everyone of you who practices architecture and studies it with interest in the manner required</span>\n            <span class=\"line\">by modern man, realizes that there are many human beings being deprived of the shelter of a home, while tre-</span>\n          </p>\n        </li>\n      </ul>\n\n      <section class=\"media-row\">\n        <figure class=\"placeholder\" aria-label=\"Photograph: group portrait\">\n          <div class=\"placeholder-label\">[Photograph: group portrait]</div>\n        </figure>\n\n        <figcaption class=\"photo-caption\">\n          <span class=\"line\">Arq. Jorge L. Medellin, Undersecretary</span>\n          <span class=\"line\">of Mexico's Department of National</span>\n          <span class=\"line\">Patrimony arriving in Juarez. Shown l.</span>\n          <span class=\"line\">to r. are: Edwin F. Carroll, FAIA, Ed-</span>\n          <span class=\"line\">ward Moe, AIA AIP, Medellin, Arq.</span>\n          <span class=\"line\">Victor Sosa Velasquez of Mexico's Pro-</span>\n          <span class=\"line\">grama Nacional Fronterizo and Arq.</span>\n          <span class=\"line\">Ramon Corona Martin, Hon. FAIA of</span>\n          <span class=\"line\">Mexico City.</span>\n        </figcaption>\n      </section>\n    </section>\n\n    <footer class=\"footer\">\n      <span class=\"page-number\">14</span>\n      <span class=\"publication\">TEXAS ARCHITECT</span>\n    </footer>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>"
